        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Bilibino Nuclear Power Plant\n- Projects: Shutdown procedure, floating nuclear power station\n- People: Mikhail Lomonosov\n- Topics: Venus atmosphere discovery\n\nFacts:\n- Plans to begin a shutdown procedure for the Bilibino Nuclear Power Plant in mid 2019 were announced.\n- The Bilibino Nuclear Power Plant was to be replaced by a floating nuclear power station.\n- The floating nuclear power station was named after Mikhail Lomonosov.\n- Mikhail Lomonosov was a Russian polymath, scientist, and writer.\n- Mikhail Lomonosov is credited with discovering the atmosphere of Venus.",
